UnitArbitraryActions::constructor
├── when signature is provided
│   ├── given the selector matches the callData
│   │   ├── it should add the actions to the actions array with correct values
│   │   ├── it should emit the events
│   │   └── it should save the entire array of actions
│   └── given the selector does not match the callData
│       └── it should revert with SelectorMismatch
└── when signature is not provided
    ├── it should add the actions to the actions array with correct values
    ├── it should emit the events
    └── it should save the entire array of actions
